# First person drawn by DCLF by default (no CS_DCLF_FIRST_PERSON). Whiterun at midday in first person: empty-handed, then an iron sword
# (12eb7) and a torch (1d4ec) drawn, with a turn; each view shot with DCLF's first person, then with the engine's (dclf:first person=0).
# Compare each shot with its -engine twin: arms, hands, sword and torch handle in the same place, same shading and shadow; the torch's
# light on the arms; nothing missing or doubled. The torch flame and first-person HeatRefraction stay the engine's in both. Watch for the
# open defect "flickering fog-coloured bands in first person" (dclf-open-defects.md) in the turn's shots.
# Log: the first person report line ("[DCLF] first person (T7e, CS_DCLF_FIRST_PERSON ...)": colour epochs counted, none failed), no
# "first person stays the engine's" warning, no <- FIRST PERSON, no [E] but EFFECTS11's.
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=300:set timescale to 0;301:set gamehour to 13;302:fw 81a;400:coc Whiterun;1300:set timescale to 0;1310:tai;1320:dclf:pov=first;1500:dclf:shot=fp-empty;1520:dclf:first person=0;1700:dclf:shot=fp-empty-engine;1720:dclf:first person=1;1750:player.additem 12eb7 1;1760:player.additem 1d4ec 1;1780:player.equipitem 12eb7;1790:player.equipitem 1d4ec;2000:dclf:shot=fp-armed;2020:dclf:first person=0;2200:dclf:shot=fp-armed-engine;2220:dclf:first person=1;2700:dclf:shot=fp-turn;2720:dclf:first person=0;2900:dclf:shot=fp-turn-engine;2920:dclf:first person=1
CS_DCLF_TEST_TURN=2300:2700:0.2
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3000
